    "isolation": "将对应 base/A/B 的 more_itertools 包分别复制到本审查员独立临时目录；每份使用单独 python -B 子进程，以 PYTHONPATH、PROBE_COPY、PYTHONDONTWRITEBYTECODE=1 隔离，并断言实际导入来自对应副本。仅本地构造有限输入和故意失败的迭代器，没有修改待审副本。",
    "oracle": "独立使用标准库 itertools.combinations 的结果与 Python list 索引语义，不复制 nth_combination 的组合计数或选择算法。较大索引用 itertools.islice 获取标准库期望值。",
    "model_calls": 0,
    "network_calls": 0,
    "delegations": 0,
    "candidate_tests_executed": false,
    "checks_are_behavioral_not_loc_or_test_count": true,
    "source": "import itertools\nimport json\nimport os\nfrom pathlib import Path\nimport more_itertools\nfrom more_itertools import recipes\n\nassert Path(recipes.__file__).resolve().is_relative_to(Path(os.environ['PROBE_COPY']).resolve())\nnth = more_itertools.nth_combination\nresults = []\n\n\ndef eq(actual, expected):\n    assert actual == expected, (repr(actual), repr(expected))\n\n\ndef raises(expected, function, same=None):\n    try:\n        function()\n    except expected as exc:\n        if same is not None:\n            assert exc is same\n        return exc\n    else:\n        raise AssertionError(f'{expected.__name__} not raised')\n\n\ndef check(name, function):\n    try:\n        detail = function()\n        results.append({'id':name,'status':'pass','detail':detail})\n    except Exception as exc:\n        results.append({'id':name,'status':'fail','error':type(exc).__name__,'message':str(exc)})\n\n\ndef exhaustive_selection():\n    count = 0\n    for size in range(8):\n        values = list(range(size))\n        for r in range(size+1):\n            expected = list(itertools.combinations(values,r))\n            for index in range(-len(expected),len(expected)):\n                eq(nth(values,r,index),expected[index])\n                count += 1\n    for r in range(5):\n        values = 'baca'\n        expected = list(itertools.combinations(values,r))\n        for index in range(-len(expected),len(expected)):\n            eq(nth(values,r,index),expected[index])\n            count += 1\n    return {'selected_indices_checked':count,'oracle':'stdlib itertools.combinations and Python list indexing'}\n\n\ndef nonexistent_combination_indices():\n    count = 0\n    for values in ([],list('abc'),list(range(9))):\n        for r in (len(values)+1,len(values)+4):\n            assert list(itertools.combinations(values,r)) == []\n            for index in (-100,-1,0,1,100):\n                raises(IndexError,lambda:nth(values,r,index))\n                count += 1\n    return {'nonexistent_indices_checked':count}\n\n\ndef negative_r():\n    for values in ([],[1,2,3]):\n        for r in (-1,-4):\n            for index in (-100,0,100):\n                raises(ValueError,lambda:nth(values,r,index))\n\n\ndef valid_r_out_of_bounds_and_zero():\n    count = 0\n    for size in range(8):\n        values = list(range(size))\n        for r in range(size+1):\n            expected = list(itertools.combinations(values,r))\n            for index in (-len(expected)-1,len(expected)):\n                raises(IndexError,lambda:nth(values,r,index))\n                count += 1\n        eq(nth(values,0,0),())\n        eq(nth(values,0,-1),())\n        eq(nth(values,size,0),tuple(values))\n        eq(nth(values,size,-1),tuple(values))\n    return {'out_of_bounds_indices_checked':count}\n\n\ndef one_shot_input_consumption():\n    class Tracked:\n        def __init__(self,values):\n            self.values = iter(values)\n            self.iter_calls = 0\n            self.next_calls = 0\n        def __iter__(self):\n            self.iter_calls += 1\n            if self.iter_calls > 1:\n                raise AssertionError('input traversed twice')\n            return self\n        def __next__(self):\n            self.next_calls += 1\n            return next(self.values)\n    values = Tracked(['a','b','c'])\n    eq(nth(values,2,1),('a','c'))\n    eq((values.iter_calls,values.next_calls),(1,4))\n    for r,error in ((-1,ValueError),(4,IndexError)):\n        values = Tracked(['a','b','c'])\n        raises(error,lambda:nth(values,r,0))\n        eq((values.iter_calls,values.next_calls),(1,4))\n\n\ndef input_errors_propagate():\n    for r in (-1,1,10):\n        failure = RuntimeError('input failed during materialization')\n        events = []\n        def values():\n            events.append('first')\n            yield 'a'\n            events.append('failure')\n            raise failure\n        raises(RuntimeError,lambda:nth(values(),r,0),failure)\n        eq(events,['first','failure'])\n    failure = KeyboardInterrupt('input interrupted')\n    class Interrupted:\n        def __iter__(self):\n            raise failure\n    raises(KeyboardInterrupt,lambda:nth(Interrupted(),1,0),failure)\n\n\ndef identity_order_and_public_forms():\n    class Item:\n        def __eq__(self,other):\n            raise AssertionError('element equality should not be consulted')\n        def __lt__(self,other):\n            raise AssertionError('elements should not be sorted')\n    a,b,c = Item(),Item(),Item()\n    values = [c,a,b,a]\n    snapshot_ids = [id(item) for item in values]\n    expected = list(itertools.combinations(values,2))\n    for index in (0,2,-1):\n        actual = nth(iterable=values,r=2,index=index)\n        assert isinstance(actual,tuple)\n        assert all(left is right for left,right in zip(actual,expected[index]))\n        eq(len(actual),len(expected[index]))\n    eq([id(item) for item in values],snapshot_ids)\n    eq(nth('abc',2,index=1),('a','c'))\n    eq(nth(iter('abc'),r=2,index=-1),('b','c'))\n\n\ndef larger_direct_selection():\n    values = range(30)\n    r,index = 4,10001\n    expected = next(itertools.islice(itertools.combinations(values,r),index,None))\n    eq(nth(values,r,index),expected)\n    expected_last = tuple(range(26,30))\n    eq(nth(values,r,-1),expected_last)\n    # This is an output check; no runtime or complexity claim is measured.\n\n\ncheck('exhaustive_positive_negative_index_stdlib_oracle',exhaustive_selection)\ncheck('r_above_length_any_index_is_indexerror',nonexistent_combination_indices)\ncheck('negative_r_stays_valueerror',negative_r)\ncheck('valid_r_invalid_index_empty_and_full_width',valid_r_out_of_bounds_and_zero)\ncheck('one_shot_materialization_once_including_error_paths',one_shot_input_consumption)\ncheck('unexpected_input_runtimeerror_keyboardinterrupt_identity',input_errors_propagate)\ncheck('public_keyword_forms_object_identity_input_order',identity_order_and_public_forms)\ncheck('larger_index_stdlib_islice_oracle',larger_direct_selection)\nprint(json.dumps({'module':recipes.__file__,'results':results},ensure_ascii=True))\n",
